## Limits

- The rows are unverified (round 2 is pending). Herrero-Sanchez 2018 and Brunel 2018 should be checked first.
- Brunel 2018 states "the minor allele", so its effect allele is inferred from European frequencies.
- The Chinese and Thai cohorts use European haplotype frequencies.
- Five studies is few. The priors on the pooled effect and on tau are proposals.
- Of 162 usable PTX3 rows, 104 map: 39 are three-group comparisons, 18 are heterozygote-only contrasts and 1 has an
  estimate outside its own interval.
